{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Helvetica;}}\f0\fs24 {\b Topology}\par 1. Google Sheets - LOOKUP: read the rating guide and went through each engineer's numbers for the half\par 2. Google Docs - LOOKUP: read the peer feedback and 1:1 notes and pointed out the key points for each person\par 3. Google Sheets - MODIFY: scored each engineer by category, set final ratings, checked the team spread and downloaded the workbook\par 4. Google Docs - CREATE: wrote the review summary with ratings, reasons and next-half goals and downloaded it as a PDF\par \par {\b Request}\par I'm the tech lead for a small payments platform team, and it's time for half-year reviews. I need to decide a performance rating for each of my four engineers and give each of them one clear goal for the next half. In Google Sheets I'll go through our rating guide and each person's numbers for April to September, like commitments met, rework, incidents and code reviews. In Google Docs I'll read the peer feedback and my 1:1 notes and highlight what actually matters. Then back in Sheets I'll score each engineer on delivery, quality, teamwork and growth, pick a final rating, and check the team spread against the guide. Last, I'll write a short review summary in Google Docs with each person's rating, the reason, and their goal for next half. Deliverables are the ratings workbook and the review summary as a PDF.\par \par {\b Task Description}\par 1. In Google Sheets, read the rating guide: the 1 to 5 scale, the category weights, what each level should look like and the spread rule.\par 2. In Google Sheets, go through each engineer's numbers for April to September and point out what stands out.\par 3. In Google Docs, read the peer feedback and 1:1 notes and point out what changes the picture for each person.\par 4. In Google Sheets, score each engineer on delivery, quality, teamwork and growth, check the weighted score and pick a final rating.\par 5. In Google Sheets, check the team spread is within the guide and download the workbook.\par 6. In Google Docs, write each person's rating, the reason and one goal for next half, and download the summary as a PDF.\par }